{"version":1,"content":"<p>一塊據稱是英偉達未發佈的GeForce RTX 4090 Ti工程樣卡，近日出現在中國二手交易平台。賣家展示的GPU-Z截圖標出18176個CUDA核心、192個光柵單元和568個紋理單元；相比正式版RTX 4090的16384個CUDA核心，核心數量多約11%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586636.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:17:34.982318+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:52:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T12:10:57.734238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:10:57.734238+00:00","content_hash":"27c3f7998ceeea354a4f91e21f44eef6d5ec57b102bab96caedb6dcf6a226a3d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}